# Local RAG (RTX 5060 Ti)

- Source of truth: `ROADMAP_local_RAG_RTX5060Ti_16GB.md` + `CODEX_CURSOR_PROMPT_RTX5060Ti_16GB.md`.
- Quality context (read/update like the system): `docs/SKILLS.md`, `docs/ERRORS.md`, `docs/ABILITIES.md` (also `Обучение/docs/*`).
- Runtime: WSL2 Ubuntu-24.04 + Docker Engine (not Docker Desktop). VHDX/data on **D:**; keep **C: ≥ 50 GB** free.
- MVP: one LLM generation, one ingestion job; Ollama on GPU; embeddings/Docling CPU-only.
- Never trust client tenant/ACL fields; PostgreSQL is source of truth.
- Do not claim GPU/WSL checks passed without artifacts under `artifacts/<run-id>/`.
- No cloud document transmission; `OLLAMA_NO_CLOUD=1`.
- Corpus switch: UI «Очистить всё хранилище» / `reset-rag` + filename prefix; skills/errors/abilities в `docs/` сохраняются.
- Multi-topic: separate prefixes (`classic_`, `wildlife_`) or comma list; never mix without prefix policy.
- Offline Python: `vendor/python-wheels` via `scripts/vendor-python-wheels.sh` (no PyPI on each start).
- Multi-chat: before work `git status` + `git log -5` + `docs/progress.md`; after a finished slice commit (no secrets); do not clobber unexplained dirty trees.
